        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: बस्ती",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बस्ती — bastī — \"a settlement; a poor quarter\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नदी के पार एक छोटी बस्ती है। nadī ke pār ek choṭī bastī hai. There is a small settlement across the river."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बस्ती (bastī) is usually traced to Sanskrit vasati, \"staying, a dwelling-place\" (Monier-Williams), from the root vas, \"to dwell\". A बस्ती can be a hamlet or a crowded poor quarter of a city."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
